Try 2 × 3 × 3 × 12 → 12 > 9

Try 4 × 4 × 3 × 7 = same as (3, 4, 4, 7)

Try 2 × 2 × 3 × 28 → 28 > 9

Try 2 × 6 × 5 × 5.6 → no

So the only valid combinations are:

- (2, 2, 6, 7)
- (3, 4, 4, 7)
- (2, 3, 7, 8)

